  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILAC Training of judges in Tunisia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ILAC Utbildning av domare i Tunisien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att utbilda hela den tunisiska         domark&#xe5;ren i fr&#xe5;gor som r&#xf6;r till&#xe4;mpningen av internationella          m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttighetskonventioner, och domark&#xe5;rens oberoende.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to provide training for the   entire Tunisian corps of judges. The training will focus on improving the judge&apos;s knowledge and use of international human rights           conventions, and the concept of the independence of the judiciary.</narrative>
  </description>
